From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:58:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] BlueOS: Hide Contributors from About phone

The contributors cloud is drawn in the shape of the LineageOS logo. Credit stays in the legal info.

Change-Id: I3167fd29774d5d02ebfad16b6169919d9f2b8856
---
 AndroidManifest.xml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/AndroidManifest.xml b/AndroidManifest.xml
index 67dd1f9..250c3e9 100644
--- a/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -302,8 +302,8 @@
             android:exported="true"
             android:label="@string/contributors_cloud_fragment_title"
             android:targetActivity="PartsActivity">
+            <!-- BlueOS: not shown in About phone (no IA_SETTINGS action) -->
             <intent-filter>
-                <action android:name="com.android.settings.action.IA_SETTINGS" />
                 <action android:name="org.lineageos.lineageparts.CONTRIBUTORS_CLOUD" />
                 <category android:name="android.intent.category.DEFAULT" />
             </intent-filter>
